{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 19, "data": [{"docid2": 2206258, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政管理", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/t20260511_2206258.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）城市管理局：\n　　《三明市城市养犬管理条例》（以下简称《条例》）自2023年9月1日起施行，全市养犬管理工作取得阶段性成效，养犬行为得到初步规范，城市人居环境持续改善。为做好市人大今年9月份《条", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/t20260511_2206258.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.10 10:08:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局关于进一步加强城市养犬管理工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管综〔2026〕23号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2026-00008", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2026.03.06 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2425489, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/t20260511_2206258.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2206239, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政管理", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/t20260511_2206239.htm", "content": "\n各县（市、区）城管局（住建局、建交局），市有关单位：\n　　为深入贯彻落实城市安全管理相关工作部署，深刻汲取近期因井盖缺失、破损、松动等导致人员坠井事件教训，牢固树立“小井盖、大民生”理念，持续解决井盖", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市城市管理局关于进一步强化检查井安全管理工作的通知", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/t20260511_2206239.htm", "docreltime": "2026.01.27 09:27:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局关于进一步强化检查井安全管理工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管综〔2026〕9号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2026-00007", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2026.01.26 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2425488, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/t20260511_2206239.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2206238, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政管理", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/szjs/szgl/202605/t20260511_2206238.htm", "content": "\n\n各县（市、区）城管局、住建局、交通运输局、水利局：\n　　为进一步规范我市建筑垃圾处置排放管理，根据《中华人民共和国固体废物污染环境防治法》《城市建筑垃圾管理规定》《三明市城市建筑垃圾管理办法》等法律法", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/szjs/szgl/202605/t20260511_2206238.htm", "docreltime": "2026.01.27 09:21:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局 三明市住房和城乡建设局 明市交通运输局 三明市水利局关于加强建筑垃圾处置排放管理工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管综〔2026〕7号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2026-00006", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2026.01.26 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2417301, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/szjs/szgl/202605/t20260511_2206238.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/szjs/szgl/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2177089, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政管理", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202512/t20251216_2177089.htm", "content": "\n\n各县(市、区)城管局、住建局、发改委、公安局、财政局、自然资源局、生态环境局、交通运输局、水利局：\n　　为深入贯彻落实《福建省住房和城乡建设厅等8部门关于印发〈全省建筑垃圾排查整治实施方案〉的通知》（闽", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市城市管理局等9部门关于印发三明市建筑垃圾排查整治实施方案的通知", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202512/t20251216_2177089.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.16 17:00:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局等9部门关于印发三明市建筑垃圾排查整治实施方案的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管规 〔2025〕5号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2025-00013", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2025.11.24 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2407533, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202512/t20251216_2177089.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202512/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2158577, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政管理", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "content": "\n各县(市、区)城管局、自然资源局、住建局，各有关单位：\n　　为进一步推进我市海绵城市建设，规范海绵城市规划、设计、施工、验收、运维等环节，根据国家及福建省相关标准，结合本地实际编制了《三明市海绵城市设施", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市城市管理局 三明市自然资源局三明市住房和城乡建设局关于印发《三明市海绵城市设施运营维护技术导则》等7本技术导则的通知", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "docreltime": "2025.09.26 14:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局 三明市自然资源局三明市住房和城乡建设局关于印发《三明市海绵城市设施运营维护技术导则》等7本技术导则的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管综〔2025〕78号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2025-00012", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2025.09.26 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2363042, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市海绵城市规划设计导则.pdf", "appdocid": 2158577, "appfile": "P020250926543896925488.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202509/P020250926/P020250926543896925488.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/P020250926543896925488.pdf"}, {"appdesc": "三明市海绵城市建设工程材料应用技术导则 .pdf", "appdocid": 2158577, "appfile": "P020250926543897174086.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202509/P020250926/P020250926543897174086.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/P020250926543897174086.pdf"}, {"appdesc": "三明市海绵城市建设工程施工与质量验收技术导则.pdf", "appdocid": 2158577, "appfile": "P020250926543897286617.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appse