道燃气）2.docx", "appdocid": 1959310, "appfile": "P020230928442597479034.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202309/t20230928_1959310.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202309/P020230928/P020230928442597479034.docx", "_href": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202309/P020230928442597479034.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1930629, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政管理", "chnldocurl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202308/t20230808_1930629.htm", "content": "\n　　为加强房屋市政小散工程安全监管，落实各方安全生产主体责任，防止和减少生产安全事故发生，保障人民群众生命安全，市住建局起草了《三明市房屋市政小散工程安全生产管理暂行规定》（征求意见稿），现公开征求意", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202308/t20230808_1930629.htm", "docreltime": "2023.08.08 16:21:00", "doctitle": "关于公开征求《三明市房屋市政小散工程安全生产管理暂行规定》（征求意见稿）意见的公告", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2326522, "sourcename": "市住房和城乡建设局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202308/t20230808_1930629.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市房屋市政小散工程安全生产管理暂行规定（征求意见稿）.docx", "appdocid": 1930629, "appfile": "P020230808590467958418.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202308/t20230808_1930629.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202308/P020230808/P020230808590467958418.docx", "_href": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202308/P020230808590467958418.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202308/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1925201, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政管理", "chnldocurl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202307/t20230719_1925201.htm", "content": "\n　　为推动建设项目法人责任制，落实招标人法定的定标权，市住建局起草了《关于房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程招标项目“评定分离”的指导意见》（征求意见稿），现公开征求意见，如有意见或建议，请于2023年7月28日前", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202307/t20230719_192520